          The best garage heater is the one sized to your square footage, your insulation and your coldest week, running on a fuel you can actually supply. For most insulated two-car garages that is a 7,500-watt 240V electric unit; for uninsulated or larger spaces it is a vented gas unit heater, and nothing plugged into a 120V outlet will ever keep up.
